[53.514446, "o", "  A4: EUR, B4: 7.85, C4: 1.08, D4: 1, E4: ==ROUND(1/D5, 3) (formula, result==ROUND(1/D5, 3))\r\n  A5: GBP, B5: 9.17, C5: 1.26, D5: 1.17, E5: 1\r\n\r\nTable view:\r\nRow 1: Exchange Rate | CNY | USD | EUR | GBP\r\nRow 2: CNY | 1 | [F:=ROUND(1/B3, 3)] | [F:=ROUND(1/B4,3)] | [F:=ROUND(1/B5, 3)]\r\nRow 3: USD | 7.25 | 1 | [F:=ROUND(1/C4, 3)] | [F:=ROUND(1/C5, 3)]\r\nRow 4: EUR | 7.85 | 1.08 | 1 | [F:=ROUND(1/D5, 3)]\r\n"]
